window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>The picturesque village of Greenvale lies between the northern California coast and the majestic redwoods. It's a romantic tourist destination, renowned for its quaint shops, perfectly preserved Victorian mansions, and farm-to-table restaurants.</p> <p>For decades, the rocky shorline, daily fog, and historic cemtetery have provided a moody backdrop for filmmakers. Each year, movie fans descend on the town during Fang Fest, a weeklong celebration of things that go bump in the night.</p> <p>On the 45th anniversary of the cult classic <i>Vampires in the Fog,</i> Greenvale is overrun with cosplayers with plastic fangs and rubber stakes. They've come for a chance to see their favorite B-movie stars and horror podcasters, and take selfies where iconic scenes were filmed.</p> <p>The Ravenwood witches, Fortuna and her great-aunt Celestia, are attending the opening night festivities when a polarizing celebrity drops dead on stage. The shocking event quickly turns into a murder investigation and the Ravenwoods join forces with an offbeat crew of locals to unravel the mystery before Greenvale's spooky celebration turns into a real life horror show.</p>"; 
